SUMMARY:Soo-Young Chin & Tom visit
DESCRIPTION:<2026-06-04 Thu 15:00> Soo-Young and Tom stopping by 1942 N Alv
 arado\nThursday afternoon\, en route from Burbank (land ~2:30) to their\nF
